class_name HiFont
## Sharper 5x7 pixel font with a dark outline, for small UI text (stack counts,
## tooltips). `px` is the size of one font pixel in canvas units; the UI layer
## is scaled 2x, so px = 0.5 means one real screen pixel.

const W := 5
const H := 7
const ADVANCE := 6   # glyph width + 1 gap

## Smaller 4x6 set (digits, k, M, .) used for stack counts.
